# The Snowflake plug's client side, for episode images built with
# `--warehouse-clients snowflake` (Dockerfile ALKERA_WAREHOUSE_CLIENTS).
# Compiled here, NOT in pyproject/uv.lock: dbt-snowflake caps certifi below
# 2025.4.26, and resolving it with the gateway would hold back every image's
# CA bundle. Constrained to the base, native and ds locks, so every package it
# shares with them is the same version; certifi is the one deliberate
# exception (snowflake-clients.overrides). Regenerate with the command in
# requirements-snowflake.lock's header.
snowflake-connector-python>=3,<5
dbt-snowflake>=1.9,<2
